*.log

# Mojang binaries. Never committed -- see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Licensing discipline".
# srv/ holds the maintainer's own copy of the a1.1.2-era server jar, used to verify
# the codec against a real server. It is a local file, never redistributed.
/srv/
*.jar

# The ELF matching whatever is in build/ right now. It is a live pointer, not an
# archived crash -- crashlogs/<dir>/*.elf are the pairs worth keeping, and this one
# is replaced on every build. Tracking it added a 27 MB blob to history per rebuild.
# See crashlogs/README.md.
/crashlogs/current-build.elf
